        "original_id": "2a3a9874-f48e-57ca-a12a-992ee1663538",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Secretariat; The One and Only, Genuine, Original Family Band\n- Companies: Walt Disney Pictures; Walt Disney Productions\n- People: Mike Rich; Sheldon Turner; Nick Glennie-Smith; Randall Wallace; Laura Bower Van Nuys; Michael O'Herlihy; Sherman Brothers\n- Topics: American film; biographical sports drama; musical film\n\nFacts:\n- The One and Only, Genuine, Original Family Band is a 1968 American musical film from Walt Disney Productions.\n- The One and Only, Genuine, Original Family Band is based on a biography by Laura Bower Van Nuys.\n- The One and Only, Genuine, Original Family Band was directed by Michael O'Herlihy and features original music and lyrics by the Sherman Brothers.\n- Secretariat is a 2010 American biographical sports drama film produced and released by Walt Disney Pictures.\n- Secretariat was written by Mike Rich and Sheldon Turner.\n- Secretariat was directed by Randall Wallace and has music by Nick Glennie-Smith.",
